## Somewhere to leave the car

Guests get a discounted rate at the Q-Park garage close to the hotel. Ask at reception and we will sort it out.

De Pijp is not a neighbourhood to circle for on-street parking in, and almost nothing you have come to see needs the car once you are here: the tram stops at the end of the street and the city is flat enough to cross by bike in half an hour.
